            "line": 461,
            "text": "theorem divergence_curl_zero {U : Set D} {R : D → ℝ} {Vr Vθ Vz : D → D}\n    (G : CylindricalGeometry U R Vr Vθ Vz) {B : D → ComplexVector}\n    (hB : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ B U) {x : D} (hx : x ∈ U) :\n    HarmonicCalculus.cylindricalDivergence R Vr Vθ Vz (cylindricalCurl R Vr Vθ Vz B) x = 0"
